  "abstract": "Re-run our best Fourier LN + learnable \u03b3 to correctly export the learned \u03b3[t] from trained params (fixing prior export bug that logged a template ramp). Config matches ID 450: p=36, H=160, drop=0.05, Adam lr=9e\u22124, clip=1.0, \u03bb_curv=1e\u22124, 60min. complete() saves \u03b3[t] and summary to storage.",
